  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "軍から民間に払い下げられたMSをスポーツ競技向けに改修した機体であるホビー・ハイザックを「A.O.Z RE-BOOT」版として、1/144スケールで立体化！",
      "en": "Hobby Hizack, an aircraft that was refurbished for sports competitions from an MS sold to the private sector by the military, has been made into a 1/144 Scale three-dimensional version as the \"A.O.Z RE-BOOT\" version!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "「GUNDAM SIDE-F」で先行販売いたします。",
      "en": "Pre-sale at \"GUNDAM SIDE-F\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 視認性の高い特徴的なカラーリングを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduces distinctive coloring that is highly visible."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 『A.O.Z RE-BOOT』版の特徴的なシルエットを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduces the characteristic silhouette of the \"A.O.Z RE-BOOT\" version."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 股関節や胴体をはじめ各部関節が可動。またバックパック部分のスラスターノズルが可動。様々なポージングが楽しめる。",
      "en": "• All joints including the hip and torso are movable. Also, the thruster nozzle in the backpack part is movable. You can enjoy various poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パーツを取り外すことでモノアイが可動。",
      "en": "• Monoeye can be moved by removing parts."
    }
  ],
